---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ResourceBand from '../components/ResourceBand.astro';
import CantFind from '../components/CantFind.astro';
---

<Base title="Arizona Microcredit Initiative |  BUSINESS EDUCATION" description="Designed for startups or established businesses, our education services cover all the business basics.">
  <ResourceBand title="EDUCATION" subtitle="Equipping entrepreneurs with fundamental business knowledge" />
  <img class="edu-photo" src="/media/760f7c_dc0c9cb6df204406af0fbf9c8dfc95a9.jpg" alt="DSC_0239.jpg" loading="eager" />

  <div class="edu-body">
    <div class="edu-inner">
      <div class="edu-text">
        <p class="lg">AMI strives to provide meaningful resources to our clients. Our new online educational materials are an extension of this effort. Below is our new interview series.</p>
        <p class="lg">In these videos, AMI staff members interviewed local Arizona small business owners to learn more about their business and their experience being a small business owner.</p>
        <p class="lg">Hear from the owners of Fair Trade Cafe and Justice Java below to understand how they started their business and are currently operating it.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Two Wix VideoPlayer widgets (YouTube). Ids come from the live page data. -->
      <div class="edu-videos">
        <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/x6lUgPoOlG4" title="AMI Interviews Fair Trade Cafe" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/jXy_6qYDf_Y" title="AMI Interviews Justice Java" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>

      <p class="edu-text lg edu-outro">We hope these accounts of other small business owners provided insight on the intricacies of operating a small business. If you are interested in learning about starting a small business, head over to our other tabs for more educational resources to aid you in crafting your business.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="edu-note"><CantFind /></div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .edu-photo { width: 100%; height: 390px; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 40%; display: block; }
  .edu-body { background: var(--grey-bg); padding-bottom: 16px; }
  .edu-inner { max-width: var(--content-width); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
  .edu-text { width: 882px; max-width: 100%; margin: 48px 0 0 29px; font-family: var(--font-avenir-light); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .edu-text p + p { margin-top: 25px; }
  .edu-text .lg, .edu-text.lg { font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.2; }
  .edu-videos { display: flex; gap: 41px; margin: 30px 0 0 52px; }
  .edu-videos iframe { width: 400px; height: 273px; border: 0; background: #000; display: block; }
  .edu-outro { margin-top: 40px; }
  .edu-note { padding: 40px 0 10px; }

  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .edu-text, .edu-videos { margin-left: 0; width: auto; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .edu-photo { height: 260px; }
    .edu-videos { flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
    .edu-videos iframe { width: 100%; max-width: 560px; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; height: auto; }
    .edu-text { margin-top: 30px; }
    .edu-text .lg, .edu-text.lg { font-size: 18px; }
  }
</style>
